## Handoffs
→ ndv-secure (vulnerability) · refund.js:5: live Stripe secret key is hardcoded as a string literal directly in source (`new Stripe('live-secret-pasted-from-the-dashboard')`) — should be loaded from an environment variable or secret manager, and the literal should be rotated since it may already be exposed in history/logs.
